cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AURORA Database: Alchemia Unified Repository for Open Research Applications"
message: >-
  Cite AURORA by name and publisher, the release you used and the date you
  accessed it. The release is shown on the platform. There is no DOI. Also cite
  the upstream sources you drew compounds from, listed in docs/SOURCES.md.
type: dataset
version: "registry release 1.9.0, unpublished"
license:
  - CC-BY-SA-4.0
  - CC-BY-NC-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/alchemia-solutions/aurora"
url: "https://alchemia.solutions"
abstract: >-
  AURORA is a molecular database for computer-aided drug design, curated by the
  ATHANOR pipeline. Its main package is licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0 and a
  companion package, AURORA-NC, under CC BY-NC 4.0. No package is published yet.
  Every complete compound has an approved 3D conformer, a docking file and the
  core feature tables. The pipeline is private and is not distributed. This
  repository describes the database, its sources and its data model.
authors:
  - name: "Alchemia LTDA"
    alias: "Alchemia Solutions"
    city: "Barretos"
    region: "São Paulo"
    country: BR
    website: "https://alchemia.solutions"
keywords:
  - cheminformatics
  - computer-aided drug design
  - natural products
  - molecular docking
  - ADMET
  - molecular database
